*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf

# README.md and brand/banner.svg are GENERATED and COMMITTED, and pr-checks.yml
# rebuilds then diffs them on a Linux runner. Left to each contributor's
# core.autocrlf, a Windows commit stores CRLF, CI regenerates LF, and every
# line differs - reported as "README.md or brand/ is stale" when nothing is.
# The generators now write \n explicitly; these two lines mean it stays true
# even for a file written by something that does not.
*.md text eol=lf
*.svg text eol=lf
